{"id": "965_gasstation_20_shop_exit|gasstation-shop-exitA|T8", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "The guy behind the counter barely looks at you as you leave.", "passage": "gasstation-shop-exitA", "source": "textasset", "es": "El tipo detrás del mostrador apenas te mira mientras te vas.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "965_gasstation_20_shop_exit|gasstation-shop-exitB|T13", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Please come back soo… »", "passage": "gasstation-shop-exitB", "speaker": "CLERK", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Por favor, vuelve pront… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "965_gasstation_20_shop_exit|gasstation-shop-exitB|T14", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "The clerk is still in the middle of his sentence when you leave the shop.", "passage": "gasstation-shop-exitB", "source": "textasset", "es": "El empleado todavía está a mitad de la frase cuando sales de la tienda.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "965_gasstation_20_shop_exit|gasstation-shop-exitC|T19", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Good… night, I guess. »", "passage": "gasstation-shop-exitC", "speaker": "CLERK", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Buenas… noches, supongo. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "965_gasstation_20_shop_exit|gasstation-shop-exitC|T20", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You nod and exit the shop.", "passage": "gasstation-shop-exitC", "source": "textasset", "es": "Asientes y sales de la tienda.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "965_gasstation_20_shop_exit|gasstation-shop-exitD|T25", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Have a good evening… »", "passage": "gasstation-shop-exitD", "speaker": "CLERK", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Que tengas buena noche… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "965_gasstation_20_shop_exit|gasstation-shop-exitD|T26", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "The cold welcomes you outside and quickly makes you forget the clerk’s unpleasant tone.", "passage": "gasstation-shop-exitD", "source": "textasset", "es": "El frío te recibe afuera y rápidamente te hace olvidar el tono desagradable del empleado.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "965_gasstation_20_shop_exit|gasstation-shop-exitE|T31", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Not a word from the guy behind the counter.", "passage": "gasstation-shop-exitE", "source": "textasset", "es": "Ni una palabra del tipo detrás del mostrador.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "965_gasstation_20_shop_exit|gasstation-shop-exitE|T32", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You, on the other hand, curse automatically as you put one foot out into the freezing cold.", "passage": "gasstation-shop-exitE", "source": "textasset", "es": "Tú, en cambio, maldices automáticamente al poner un pie afuera, en el frío glacial.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
